# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# col = awk column index ($2 = probe 0, $3 = probe 1, ...)
# Probe 0 (0.005 0.025 5e-05) - Near first stimulus
# Probe 1 (0.025 0.025 5e-05) - Center of domain
# Probe 2 (0.045 0.025 5e-05) - Far edge
# Probe 3 (0.025 0.005 5e-05) - Near second stimulus
# Probe 4 (0.025 0.045 5e-05) - Top edge
# Last activation time at t = 1.0, the regression's endTime. The S2 stimulus at
# 0.45 s starts the rotor; every value below is a later activation by the
# rotor alone (the S2 wave reached the probes by 0.59 s).
probe  postProcessing/rotorpoints/0/activationTime  1.0  2  0.888473  2e-3
probe  postProcessing/rotorpoints/0/activationTime  1.0  3  0.845604  2e-3
probe  postProcessing/rotorpoints/0/activationTime  1.0  4  0.904076  2e-3
probe  postProcessing/rotorpoints/0/activationTime  1.0  5  0.780131  2e-3
probe  postProcessing/rotorpoints/0/activationTime  1.0  6  0.942553  2e-3
